{{define "content"}}<section class="practice">
  <h1>練習</h1>

  {{/* OUTSIDE #exercise-area on purpose. Every drill response swaps that
       element's contents, so a control living inside it would be
       destroyed by the first question — taking the adapter choice with
       it. Keeping the bar here means one select, chosen once, read by
       both 練習する and the result partial's 次の問題へ.

       The adapter dropdown is the workspace's, same helper and same
       contract: this request only, never persisted, unknown value is a
       400 rather than a silent fallback.

       data-progress-into is what stops the button looking dead during a
       5-30s model call, and what SHOWS a failure — htmx does not swap a
       non-2xx response, so without it a failed drill leaves the page
       byte-identical. */}}
  <div class="practice-controls">
    <button class="btn" hx-post="/practice/start" hx-target="#exercise-area" hx-swap="innerHTML"
            hx-vals="js:{...window.jlp.practiceVals()}"
            data-progress-into="#exercise-area"
            data-progress-label-from="#provider-override"
            data-progress-verb="が問題を作成中">練習する</button>
    <select id="provider-override" name="provider_override" class="select" aria-label="AIアダプター">
      {{range .AIProviders}}<option value="{{.Name}}"{{if .Default}} selected{{end}}>{{.Label}}</option>{{end}}
    </select>
  </div>

  {{/* Which shapes of question to include. All on by default, and read
       by hx-vals on every request — they live out here with the adapter
       select, outside #exercise-area, so a choice made once survives
       every swap.

       Unticking everything is not an error: allowedKinds treats an
       absent selection as "all", and the run carries on rather than
       refusing to produce a question. */}}
  <fieldset id="drill-kinds" class="drill-kinds">
    <legend class="drill-kinds__legend">出題の種類</legend>
    <label class="drill-kind"><input type="checkbox" name="kind" value="word" checked> 語彙</label>
    <label class="drill-kind"><input type="checkbox" name="kind" value="grammar" checked> 文法</label>
    <label class="drill-kind"><input type="checkbox" name="kind" value="passage" checked> 読解</label>
  </fieldset>

  <div id="exercise-area">
    <p class="practice-intro">「練習する」を押すと、あなたの学習状況に合わせた問題が出題されます。</p>
  </div>
</section>{{end}}
